OL,5,G1530 You're Dead to Me
OL,6,     FGreg Jenner is joined in Victorian
OL,7,     FEngland by Subhadra Das and
OL,8,     Fcomedian Desiree Burch to learn
OL,9,     Fall about the life of scientist
OL,10,     Fand eugenics pioneer Francis
OL,11,     FGalton.
OL,12,G1600 The Artificial University
OL,13,     FKathryn Claire Higgins is a
OL,14,     Fworking academic in the UK - and
OL,15,     Fwants to raise the alarm. Can
OL,16,     Funiversity education survive AI?
OL,17,G1630 The Kitchen Cabinet
OL,18,     F2/6. Jay Rayner and the panel are
OL,19,     Fin Spalding discussing Lithuanian
OL,20,     Fcooking, recipes for potatoes,
OL,21,     Fcooking with sage and the best way
OL,22,     Fto cook a pork chop.
