OL,9,     Fwhat shaped theirs.
OL,10,G2200 The World Tonight
OL,11,G2245 Operation Rex by Damian Barr
OL,12,     F1/5. As the Second World War
OL,13,     Floomed, hundreds of thousands of
OL,14,     Fpet owners faced an impossible
OL,15,     Fchoice. Inspired by real events,
OL,16,     FDamian Barr imagines one boy's
OL,17,     Fquest to save his dog.
